@tempo 88
@swing 0.58
@fx vinyl 0.28
@fx reverb 0.38
@fx lowpass 0.55
//@instrument lead flute 0.9
@instrument chord pad 0.6

// Spanish/Flamenco lofi: A harmonic minor (A B C D E F G#)
// Andalusian cadence: Am - G - F - E (the defining Spanish sound)
// G# (raised 7th) creates the characteristic tension

kick:   x . . . x . . . x . . . x . x .
snare:  . . . . x . . . . . . . x . . .
hat:    x . x . x x x . x . x . x . x .
clap:   . . x . . . . . . . x . . . . .
perc:   . . . . . . x . . . . . . x . .

bass:   A2 . . . E2 . . . A2 . . . G#2 . A2 .
        D2 . . . A2 . . . F2 . . . E2 . . .
        A2 . E2 . A2 . . . D2 . F2 . E2 . A2 .
        G#2 . A2 . E2 . D2 . A2 . . . E2 . . .

lead:   E4 D4 C4 B3 A3 G#3 A3 B3
        C4 B3 A3 G#3 A3 E3 A3 .
        A3 B3 C4 D4 E4 F4 E4 D4
        C4 B3 A3 G#3 E3 G#3 A3 .

        E4 F4 E4 D4 C4 D4 C4 B3
        A3 G#3 A3 B3 C4 B3 A3 G#3
        A3 C4 E4 D4 C4 B3 A3 G#3
        A3 . G#3 A3 B3 A3 G#3 .

chords: Am G F E
        Am G F E

// Bass: roots of Andalusian cadence, G# pedal creates flamenco tension
// Lead: descending Andalusian runs, F-E half-step and G#-A resolution
// Chords: Am-G-F-E is the defining Andalusian cadence
